                                                "example_id": "b310a5bd-a659-4056-bcfc-7f944c66effd",
                                                "sense_id": "fd36e19d-49aa-37ea-90cc-527eb82e5040",
                                                "text": "One of the nodes in a depiction is identified as the depictee; depictions describe their depictee in terms of their other nodes, which are known as depicters."
                                            },
