                                                "example_id": "47363349-5e71-4480-b144-8981ee08ce7b",
                                                "sense_id": "fd36e19d-49aa-37ea-90cc-527eb82e5040",
                                                "text": "In the depiction D-HUMAN, N-ARM acts as a depicter; at the same time, in D-ARM, N-ARM is the depictee—the subject of the depiction."
